"The constructor arguments are the static template parameters. Calling "
"``run_l1_tile`` emits the L1->L0 sub-K pipeline for one already-loaded L1 "
"tile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/contrib/ptodsl/gemm/index.rst:27
msgid ""
"dav-3510 requires the TRANS_B=true path. The right operand must be staged in "
"L1 as logical W[N, K]. If you write NN matmul with W[K, N], then during GM-"
">L1 you must use DN2NZ to transpose B into this layout before calling the "
"helper."
msgstr ""

